<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1526971177497657476 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1526971177497657476><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Wednesday, July 15, 2026 11:18 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1526971177497657476>7/15/2026 11:18 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>วันที่จิตวิญญาณของฉันกลับคืนมา <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128330;️"
    title="dove"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f54a.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128148;"
